### 11.3 — Shadow Pipeline Mode
- [ ] Add `shadow_pipeline: bool` config flag (default: true during rollout)
- [ ] When shadow=true: run both old path + new pipeline, diff outputs
- [ ] Log diff to trace (ContextAssemblyTrace) — no user-visible change
- [ ] Metric: shadow_diff_count (should trend to zero)
- [ ] When shadow=false: pipeline is sole path (flip after validation)

### 11.4 — Serialize Phase Wire-up
- [ ] ContextOptimized.system_blocks → replace system_prompt string in payload
- [ ] ContextOptimized.messages → replace messages[] in payload
- [ ] ContextOptimized.tools → replace edge_tools[] in payload
- [ ] ContextOptimized.cache_breakpoints → inject cache_control into Anthropic requests
- [ ] Provider-specific serialization (Anthropic vs OpenAI-compatible vs Bedrock)

### 11.5 — Feedback Loop Wire-up ✅ DONE (library layer)
- [x] record_feedback() extracts section usage from TurnOutput
- [x] PipelineStats.record() updates EMA cache ratio + response token percentile
- [x] PipelineStats carried across turns (PipelineSession ownership)
- [x] Warm start: PipelineSession::with_warm_stats() loads from persistence
- [x] serialize_stats/deserialize_stats for Phase 12 persistence
- [ ] Runtime wire: extract cache metrics from API response (CLI layer work)

### 11.6 — Integration Tests ✅ DONE
