## Acceptance Criteria
- All existing tests pass (no regression)
- Shadow mode diff is zero for all existing E2E scenarios
- Pipeline-only mode produces valid requests accepted by providers
- Cache hit ratio >= baseline (measured over 10+ turn sessions)
- No performance regression > 5ms per turn (pipeline overhead budget)

## Key Files
- astra-turn-core/src/context_sources.rs (extend ContextSources)
- astra-turn-core/src/context_pipeline.rs (run() entry point)
- astra-cli/src/cli/chat_stream/sse_loop/agentic_loop_turn.rs (call site)
- astra-cli/src/cli/chat_stream/sse_loop/cli_loop_host.rs (state carrier)
- runtime/src/prompts/system.rs (becomes input to Bind phase)
- astra-gateway/src/gateway_context.rs (becomes StaticSections source)
